@JamesNK and @MonstraG I corrected my comment above.  I'm sorry for making that mistake. Here was my actual example I was struggling with. Seems like I might need to retest once 8.0.3 is release.

This code has warning.
```
[Route("api/[controller]/[action]")]
[ApiController]
public class MyController : ControllerBase
{
	[HttpGet("{id}")]
	public IActionResult GetTime(int id) => Ok(DateTime.Now.ToString("HH:mm:ss"));
    
	[HttpGet("{id}")]
	public IActionResult GetDate(int id) => Ok(DateTime.Now.ToString("yyyy-MM-dd"));
}
```

This doesn't have warnings.
```
[Route("api/[controller]")]
[ApiController]
public class MyController : ControllerBase
{
	[HttpGet("[action]/{id}")]
	public IActionResult GetTime(int id) => Ok(DateTime.Now.ToString("HH:mm:ss"));
    
	[HttpGet("[action]/{id}")]
	public IActionResult GetDate(int id) => Ok(DateTime.Now.ToString("yyyy-MM-dd"));
}
```
